<title>USA: Periphonics Corp prices 1.1 mln shr offer.</title>
<headline>Periphonics Corp prices 1.1 mln shr offer.</headline>
<dateline>BOHEMIA, NEW YORK 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Periphonics Corp said on Tuesday that it priced its public offering of 1.1 million common shares at $18.25 a share.</p>
<p>The company said the price reflects its two-for-one split paid as a stock dividend on October 31.</p>
<p>Periphonics said underwriters have a 30-day option to buy up to 165,000 common shares to cover over-allotments.</p>
<p>All shares will be sold by certain stockholders, the company said.</p>
</text>
